      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_25e3bad410702c550995242a_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Spreadsheets are a new type of note introduced in v0.103.0 and are currently considered experimental/beta. As such, expect major changes to occur to this note type.",
      "sourceHash": "25e3bad410702c550995242ac6471f3777597d05328a328a6f23839ad52e5bf4",
      "context": "Spreadsheets",
      "contextHash": "fdae6602c2bebdcc277f82edeb2c3d448d5695dc2fc6650fe58dcabc3f179ad9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f3bc0acbf295880653092713_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Spreadsheets provide a familiar experience to Microsoft Excel or LibreOffice Calc, with support for formulas, data validation and text formatting.",
      "sourceHash": "f3bc0acbf29588065309271317a7d5dc8c0d640384a3567611d2e0179f5f51da",
      "context": "Spreadsheets",
      "contextHash": "fdae6602c2bebdcc277f82edeb2c3d448d5695dc2fc6650fe58dcabc3f179ad9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_5c61f39b4dbc764d41a9bc32_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Spreadsheets vs. collections__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "5c61f39b4dbc764d41a9bc32f99cfc5f1924db4690c236a7ed3512c0eb9209a0",
      "context": "Spreadsheets > Spreadsheets vs. collections",
      "contextHash": "df883b89cb954794a1af386f482843ee79216d0be417791b858a1ebbe0f14ce4",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_135a9711d1e7d105457c710f_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "There is a slight overlap between spreadsheets and the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Table__TRILIUM_PH_1__ collection. In general the table collection is useful to track meta-information about notes (for example a collection of people and their birthdays), whereas spreadsheets are quite useful for calculations since they support formulas.",
      "sourceHash": "135a9711d1e7d105457c710f0f8269c4f79efe3e925c63b0b8eb2ea3ffd856f9",
      "context": "Spreadsheets > Spreadsheets vs. collections",
      "contextHash": "df883b89cb954794a1af386f482843ee79216d0be417791b858a1ebbe0f14ce4",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d8f35bc7a24c30cfbb9bfcbd_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Spreadsheets also benefit from a wider range of features such as data validation, formatting and can work on a relatively large dataset.",
      "sourceHash": "d8f35bc7a24c30cfbb9bfcbd2749b42f779c745f186f5580977d7655266d9593",
      "context": "Spreadsheets > Spreadsheets vs. collections",
      "contextHash": "df883b89cb954794a1af386f482843ee79216d0be417791b858a1ebbe0f14ce4",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_df78d565c86fe5b7e56e8d3b_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Data intercompatibility (import/export)__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "df78d565c86fe5b7e56e8d3b3b3164d6574ef3166fc49d6bb36f18ac4c217f96",
      "context": "Spreadsheets > Data intercompatibility (import/export)",
      "contextHash": "eb921093113a64af84e5e4a5dda57ead15692eb4ee76c5861b280b65e59e7de9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_8e15b40f9bcc986223a4a05f_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Starting with v0.104.0, Trilium provides a level of data intercompatibility between the internal format (Univer) and the following formats:",
      "sourceHash": "8e15b40f9bcc986223a4a05f1d009e69d3620daa51816b204f0816f2a76aa5a5",
      "context": "Spreadsheets > Data intercompatibility (import/export)",
      "contextHash": "eb921093113a64af84e5e4a5dda57ead15692eb4ee76c5861b280b65e59e7de9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_9fc30d2803c244858e3c6f2f_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Microsoft Excel (.xlsx)",
      "sourceHash": "9fc30d2803c244858e3c6f2f897d5fdcd311278a25ff0d1e5e3111deb1736a7f",
      "context": "Spreadsheets > Data intercompatibility (import/export)",
      "contextHash": "eb921093113a64af84e5e4a5dda57ead15692eb4ee76c5861b280b65e59e7de9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_05e3b14295753e275eddebb6_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Preserves basic formatting (fonts, sizes, borders, backgrounds).",
      "sourceHash": "05e3b14295753e275eddebb6e5427ce59df92f4142f81dc63849d1715e452f81",
      "context": "Spreadsheets > Data intercompatibility (import/export)",
      "contextHash": "eb921093113a64af84e5e4a5dda57ead15692eb4ee76c5861b280b65e59e7de9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_1c32d2d44221eb7eb634eaea_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Formulas are preserved, but note that not all Excel functions are supported and vice-versa with Univer.",
      "sourceHash": "1c32d2d44221eb7eb634eaea2aafd284d3bc47720a454a5ba6c596613425c63f",
      "context": "Spreadsheets > Data intercompatibility (import/export)",
      "contextHash": "eb921093113a64af84e5e4a5dda57ead15692eb4ee76c5861b280b65e59e7de9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_02a30d32cf6e7fc8417b8d85_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Images (cell-bound or floating), without preserving rotation.",
      "sourceHash": "02a30d32cf6e7fc8417b8d85d82bc773ce14c32e45a8849f7def23c79cde4e31",
      "context": "Spreadsheets > Data intercompatibility (import/export)",
      "contextHash": "eb921093113a64af84e5e4a5dda57ead15692eb4ee76c5861b280b65e59e7de9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_442a284436c8c09d87219286_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Supports multi-sheets natively.",
      "sourceHash": "442a284436c8c09d87219286b950f7c9530652a27b6c4ce20a04aac325a966d5",
      "context": "Spreadsheets > Data intercompatibility (import/export)",
      "contextHash": "eb921093113a64af84e5e4a5dda57ead15692eb4ee76c5861b280b65e59e7de9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_8c9ede2af603deb518821238_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Comma-Separated Values (.csv)",
      "sourceHash": "8c9ede2af603deb518821238b786667f621cacf017a7412c3bd2b7c7c0f36c12",
      "context": "Spreadsheets > Data intercompatibility (import/export)",
      "contextHash": "eb921093113a64af84e5e4a5dda57ead15692eb4ee76c5861b280b65e59e7de9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_11a5a41e9b261be31ca0cc5e_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Since it's a text-based format, any formatting is lost.",
      "sourceHash": "11a5a41e9b261be31ca0cc5e20ee9d01c5e6dd975e8adc45e49f5cc5d0a0cb5f",
      "context": "Spreadsheets > Data intercompatibility (import/export)",
      "contextHash": "eb921093113a64af84e5e4a5dda57ead15692eb4ee76c5861b280b65e59e7de9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ce1d6376f25f6c1d4d6ed848_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Formulas are evaluated and turned into their final value instead.",
      "sourceHash": "ce1d6376f25f6c1d4d6ed848ac001722bd0955b62f08b7b1f37f0e30b222ce43",
      "context": "Spreadsheets > Data intercompatibility (import/export)",
      "contextHash": "eb921093113a64af84e5e4a5dda57ead15692eb4ee76c5861b280b65e59e7de9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_51afa0a0f7426d2dfee55396_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Multi-sheets spreadsheets are exported as a single ZIP containing a CSV file per sheet.",
      "sourceHash": "51afa0a0f7426d2dfee5539607e2f7ebb406a9e8fe5d5cde517fe9897e2fe862",
      "context": "Spreadsheets > Data intercompatibility (import/export)",
      "contextHash": "eb921093113a64af84e5e4a5dda57ead15692eb4ee76c5861b280b65e59e7de9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e60d3479dcac3e0652dd12b7_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Both __TRILIUM_PH_0__import and export__TRILIUM_PH_1__ are supported, as follows:",
      "sourceHash": "e60d3479dcac3e0652dd12b7302761f7685718d17a255eb9fb3d8e4a47712110",
      "context": "Spreadsheets > Data intercompatibility (import/export)",
      "contextHash": "eb921093113a64af84e5e4a5dda57ead15692eb4ee76c5861b280b65e59e7de9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4f6e704f88008cc56ac02b52_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To import a file, simply drag it into the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note Tree__TRILIUM_PH_1__ and it will be converted into a spreadsheet note.",
      "sourceHash": "4f6e704f88008cc56ac02b52cb53ccad0257beff7ffc86068393ba73f4e4ce90",
      "context": "Spreadsheets > Data intercompatibility (import/export)",
      "contextHash": "eb921093113a64af84e5e4a5dda57ead15692eb4ee76c5861b280b65e59e7de9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_bf0fbca579fddcce9e403c8a_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "To avoid this behavior (e.g. to import a .xlsx file as an actual __TRILIUM_PH_0__File__TRILIUM_PH_1__), uncheck the corresponding option in the __TRILIUM_PH_2__Import dialog__TRILIUM_PH_3__.",
      "sourceHash": "bf0fbca579fddcce9e403c8a7bac254c4bffb127a5144c890fc6883c2b686a7b",
      "context": "Spreadsheets > Data intercompatibility (import/export)",
      "contextHash": "eb921093113a64af84e5e4a5dda57ead15692eb4ee76c5861b280b65e59e7de9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2a037de1f41e11d9e118e767_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Multiple files can be imported at the same time, including a mixture of .csv and .xlsx files. Folder structure can be preserved by using a .zip file.",
      "sourceHash": "2a037de1f41e11d9e118e767f00e1729dce9886f3396516ee725ad735284e78e",
      "context": "Spreadsheets > Data intercompatibility (import/export)",
      "contextHash": "eb921093113a64af84e5e4a5dda57ead15692eb4ee76c5861b280b65e59e7de9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_398f4432c0c95140cd65fe72_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Unlike importing, exporting is on a per-note basis:",
      "sourceHash": "398f4432c0c95140cd65fe72ce4fc924de7385569acdb99ec8b32126a0e4a5b4",
      "context": "Spreadsheets > Data intercompatibility (import/export)",
      "contextHash": "eb921093113a64af84e5e4a5dda57ead15692eb4ee76c5861b280b65e59e7de9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2b435530dce8ba88844e0f2f_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "In the __TRILIUM_PH_0__Note menu__TRILIUM_PH_1__, choose the __TRILIUM_PH_2__Export to Excel__TRILIUM_PH_3__ or __TRILIUM_PH_4__Export to CSV__TRILIUM_PH_5__ options.",
      "sourceHash": "2b435530dce8ba88844e0f2f6bb3b0ad81792be17be2d299048f86fd60fdd6cd",
      "context": "Spreadsheets > Data intercompatibility (import/export)",
      "contextHash": "eb921093113a64af84e5e4a5dda57ead15692eb4ee76c5861b280b65e59e7de9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_026bdccd2dbf4bcdb361723a_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "If exported as a single file via __TRILIUM_PH_0__Import & Export__TRILIUM_PH_1__, the resulting file will be a custom __TRILIUM_PH_2__ file that preserves the spreadsheet as-is.",
      "sourceHash": "026bdccd2dbf4bcdb361723ac5f4076284b0948ffc82fe8c1ba2707ed4a288d9",
      "context": "Spreadsheets > Data intercompatibility (import/export)",
      "contextHash": "eb921093113a64af84e5e4a5dda57ead15692eb4ee76c5861b280b65e59e7de9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4767446e30768dddd71e75ca_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The export is intentionally a different process than the normal __TRILIUM_PH_0__Import & Export__TRILIUM_PH_1__ functionality because it does conversion to multiple formats with varying degrees of compatibility.",
      "sourceHash": "4767446e30768dddd71e75caf20d446fad4d26983163256b3960f52ce5e9839f",
      "context": "Spreadsheets > Data intercompatibility (import/export)",
      "contextHash": "eb921093113a64af84e5e4a5dda57ead15692eb4ee76c5861b280b65e59e7de9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7951412a2004d2ecf0e419c5_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Cells pasted from Excel or another application keep their formatting except for the font, so they use the spreadsheet's font like the rest of the cells.",
      "sourceHash": "7951412a2004d2ecf0e419c5954f5d9038c622c2975e67ac81e424abcd40e9d9",
      "context": "Spreadsheets > Data intercompatibility (import/export)",
      "contextHash": "eb921093113a64af84e5e4a5dda57ead15692eb4ee76c5861b280b65e59e7de9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4d25128d3c95ac3f2884a4d6_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Import & export for both .xlsx and .csv files are supported on a best-effort basis. It does not support advanced features (data validation, scripting, etc.). If you notice a particular issue, it can be __TRILIUM_PH_0__reported__TRILIUM_PH_1__, however all bug reports must contain a sample file in order to be taken into consideration.",
      "sourceHash": "4d25128d3c95ac3f2884a4d691b7aaba7dd5fb7fd76ec4530671921fcb99ff86",
      "context": "Spreadsheets > Data intercompatibility (import/export)",
      "contextHash": "eb921093113a64af84e5e4a5dda57ead15692eb4ee76c5861b280b65e59e7de9",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_40ff640d4fda01902f6eb589_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Supported features__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "40ff640d4fda01902f6eb5894c960a3be0632f56de2d140fa2627699a93bdba5",
      "context": "Spreadsheets > Supported features",
      "contextHash": "ad260df9666745f1e9619f1b2de1295c244f95bbb34a5c7cc8008d13c66cca1c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_79747456ad92a35541f2e6e7_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The spreadsheet has support for the following features:",
      "sourceHash": "79747456ad92a35541f2e6e73c5298cb536cb31b3759ca4d6159a71f6313ad06",
      "context": "Spreadsheets > Supported features",
      "contextHash": "ad260df9666745f1e9619f1b2de1295c244f95bbb34a5c7cc8008d13c66cca1c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d9177dbb1ac628c6ec9c7048_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Since v0.104.0, images that can be either inside a cell or floating above.",
      "sourceHash": "d9177dbb1ac628c6ec9c7048beb3d4f578d0d3d91729f2bade19f17ec7da7eba",
      "context": "Spreadsheets > Supported features",
      "contextHash": "ad260df9666745f1e9619f1b2de1295c244f95bbb34a5c7cc8008d13c66cca1c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7fe5c5becc131830bfaba643_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The images are saved as __TRILIUM_PH_0__Attachments__TRILIUM_PH_1__ for performance reasons.",
      "sourceHash": "7fe5c5becc131830bfaba643962e19f0755d31f3789e08d86aac40c8e98233eb",
      "context": "Spreadsheets > Supported features",
      "contextHash": "ad260df9666745f1e9619f1b2de1295c244f95bbb34a5c7cc8008d13c66cca1c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_4dfbb44f940810f1136b0f8a_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The image upload respects the same compression settings as text __TRILIUM_PH_0__Images__TRILIUM_PH_1__.",
      "sourceHash": "4dfbb44f940810f1136b0f8addf395c6b0b9af842f3907e2c39450691f3df3c3",
      "context": "Spreadsheets > Supported features",
      "contextHash": "ad260df9666745f1e9619f1b2de1295c244f95bbb34a5c7cc8008d13c66cca1c",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
