    {
      "id": "u_33bf5387f7e869afbb317698_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "We might consider adding __TRILIUM_PH_0__other features__TRILIUM_PH_1__ from Univer at some point. If there is a particular feature that can be added easily, it can be discussed over __TRILIUM_PH_2__GitHub Issues__TRILIUM_PH_3__.",
